    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Slack Call Analysis Workflow\n\nThis workflow analyzes call recordings shared in Slack:\n\n1. **Trigger**: Webhook receives audio file URL from Slack\n2. **Download**: Fetches the audio file\n3. **Transcribe**: ElevenLabs STT with speaker diarization\n4. **Analyze**: Gemini analyzes sentiment, topic, summary\n5. **Report**: Sends results back via Slack webhook\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Create Slack Incoming Webhook URL\n2. Replace YOUR_SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL in nodes\n3. Configure Slack to POST to n8n webhook",
